('ed305a07-251d-5880-b621-348554f03d19'::uuid, 11, 30, 444, 444, 'लेलिह्यसे ग्रसमानः समन्ता

ल्लोकान्समग्रान्वदनैर्ज्वलद्भिः।

तेजोभिरापूर्य जगत्समग्रं

भासस्तवोग्राः प्रतपन्ति विष्णो।।11.30।।', 'lelihyase grasamānaḥ samantāl
lokān samagrān vadanair jvaladbhiḥ
tejobhir āpūrya jagat samagraṁ
bhāsas tavogrāḥ pratapanti viṣhṇo', '[{"word":"lelihyase","meaning":"you are licking"},{"word":"grasamānaḥ","meaning":"devouring"},{"word":"samantāt","meaning":"on all sides"},{"word":"lokān","meaning":"worlds"},{"word":"samagrān","meaning":"all"},{"word":"vadanaiḥ","meaning":"with mouths"},{"word":"jvaladbhiḥ","meaning":"blazing"},{"word":"tejobhiḥ","meaning":"by effulgence"},{"word":"āpūrya","meaning":"filled with"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"the universe"},{"word":"samagram","meaning":"all"},{"word":"bhāsaḥ","meaning":"rays"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"your"},{"word":"ugrāḥ","meaning":"fierce"},{"word":"pratapanti","meaning":"scorching"},{"word":"viṣhṇo","meaning":"Lord Vishnu"}]'::jsonb, 'lelihyase—you are licking; grasamānaḥ—devouring; samantāt—on all sides; lokān—worlds; samagrān—all; vadanaiḥ—with mouths; jvaladbhiḥ—blazing; tejobhiḥ—by effulgence; āpūrya—filled with; jagat—the universe; samagram—all; bhāsaḥ—rays; tava—your; ugrāḥ—fierce; pratapanti—scorching; viṣhṇo—Lord Vishnu'),
('bd507b77-94f3-5d16-9fef-e72b2813779c'::uuid, 11, 31, 445, 445, 'आख्याहि मे को भवानुग्ररूपो

नमोऽस्तु ते देववर प्रसीद।

विज्ञातुमिच्छामि भवन्तमाद्यं

न हि प्रजानामि तव प्रवृत्तिम्।।11.31।।', 'ākhyāhi me ko bhavān ugra-rūpo
namo ’stu te deva-vara prasīda
vijñātum ichchhāmi bhavantam ādyaṁ
na hi prajānāmi tava pravṛittim', '[{"word":"ākhyāhi","meaning":"tell"},{"word":"me","meaning":"me"},{"word":"kaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"bhavān","meaning":"you"},{"word":"ugra","meaning":"rūpaḥ—fierce form"},{"word":"namaḥ astu","meaning":"I bow"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"vara—God of gods"},{"word":"prasīda","meaning":"be merciful"},{"word":"vijñātum","meaning":"to know"},{"word":"ichchhāmi","meaning":"I wish"},{"word":"bhavantam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"ādyam","meaning":"the primeval"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"because"},{"word":"prajānāmi","meaning":"comprehend"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"your"},{"word":"pravṛittim","meaning":"workings"}]'::jsonb, 'ākhyāhi—tell; me—me; kaḥ—who; bhavān—you; ugra-rūpaḥ—fierce form; namaḥ astu—I bow; te—to you; deva-vara—God of gods; prasīda—be merciful; vijñātum—to know; ichchhāmi—I wish; bhavantam—you; ādyam—the primeval; na—not; hi—because; prajānāmi—comprehend; tava—your; pravṛittim—workings'),
('d8c52c70-7894-5309-a0f0-2faff73ab55c'::uuid, 11, 32, 446, 446, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

कालोऽस्मि लोकक्षयकृत्प्रवृद्धो

लोकान्समाहर्तुमिह प्रवृत्तः।

ऋतेऽपि त्वां न भविष्यन्ति सर्वे

येऽवस्थिताः प्रत्यनीकेषु योधाः।।11.32।।', 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha
kālo ’smi loka-kṣhaya-kṛit pravṛiddho
lokān samāhartum iha pravṛittaḥ
ṛite ’pi tvāṁ na bhaviṣhyanti sarve
ye ’vasthitāḥ pratyanīkeṣhu yodhāḥ', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said"},{"word":"kālaḥ","meaning":"time"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"loka","meaning":"kṣhaya-kṛit—the source of destruction of the worlds"},{"word":"pravṛiddhaḥ","meaning":"mighty"},{"word":"lokān","meaning":"the worlds"},{"word":"samāhartum","meaning":"annihilation"},{"word":"iha","meaning":"this world"},{"word":"pravṛittaḥ","meaning":"participation"},{"word":"ṛite","meaning":"without"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"tvām","meaning":"you"},{"word":"na bhaviṣhyanti","meaning":"shall cease to exist"},{"word":"sarve","meaning":"all"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"avasthitāḥ","meaning":"arrayed"},{"word":"prati","meaning":"anīkeṣhu—in the opposing army"},{"word":"yodhāḥ","meaning":"the warriors"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said; kālaḥ—time; asmi—I am; loka-kṣhaya-kṛit—the source of destruction of the worlds; pravṛiddhaḥ—mighty; lokān—the worlds; samāhartum—annihilation; iha—this world; pravṛittaḥ—participation; ṛite—without; api—even; tvām—you; na bhaviṣhyanti—shall cease to exist; sarve—all; ye—who; avasthitāḥ—arrayed; prati-anīkeṣhu—in the opposing army; yodhāḥ—the warriors'),
('e10174ad-ae31-5050-9a65-15009b027d89'::uuid, 11, 33, 447, 447, 'तस्मात्त्वमुत्तिष्ठ यशो लभस्व

जित्वा शत्रून् भुङ्क्ष्व राज्यं समृद्धम्।

मयैवैते निहताः पूर्वमेव

निमित्तमात्रं भव सव्यसाचिन्।।11.33।।', 'tasmāt tvam uttiṣhṭha yaśho labhasva
jitvā śhatrūn bhuṅkṣhva rājyaṁ samṛiddham
mayaivaite nihatāḥ pūrvam eva
nimitta-mātraṁ bhava savya-sāchin', '[{"word":"tasmāt","meaning":"therefore"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"uttiṣhṭha","meaning":"arise"},{"word":"yaśhaḥ","meaning":"honor"},{"word":"labhasva","meaning":"attain"},{"word":"jitvā","meaning":"conquer"},{"word":"śhatrūn","meaning":"foes"},{"word":"bhuṅkṣhva","meaning":"enjoy"},{"word":"rājyam","meaning":"kingdom"},{"word":"samṛiddham","meaning":"prosperous"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"ete","meaning":"these"},{"word":"nihatāḥ","meaning":"slain"},{"word":"pūrvam","meaning":"already"},{"word":"eva nimitta","meaning":"mātram—only an instrument"},{"word":"bhava","meaning":"become"},{"word":"savya","meaning":"sāchin—Arjun, the one who can shoot arrows with both hands"}]'::jsonb, 'tasmāt—therefore; tvam—you; uttiṣhṭha—arise; yaśhaḥ—honor; labhasva—attain; jitvā—conquer; śhatrūn—foes; bhuṅkṣhva—enjoy; rājyam—kingdom; samṛiddham—prosperous; mayā—by me; eva—indeed; ete—these; nihatāḥ—slain; pūrvam—already; eva nimitta-mātram—only an instrument; bhava—become; savya-sāchin—Arjun, the one who can shoot arrows with both hands'),
('2c556b1c-9a2f-5d48-8447-5d30303b5a45'::uuid, 11, 34, 448, 448, 'द्रोणं च भीष्मं च जयद्रथं च

कर्णं तथाऽन्यानपि योधवीरान्।

मया हतांस्त्वं जहि मा व्यथिष्ठा

युध्यस्व जेतासि रणे सपत्नान्।।11.34।।', 'droṇaṁ cha bhīṣhmaṁ cha jayadrathaṁ cha
karṇaṁ tathānyān api yodha-vīrān
mayā hatāṁs tvaṁ jahi mā vyathiṣhṭhā
yudhyasva jetāsi raṇe sapatnān', '[{"word":"droṇam","meaning":"Dronacharya"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"bhīṣhmam","meaning":"Bheeshma"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"jayadratham","meaning":"Jayadratha"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"karṇam","meaning":"Karn"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"also"},{"word":"anyān","meaning":"others"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"yodha","meaning":"vīrān—brave warriors"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"hatān","meaning":"already killed"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"jahi","meaning":"slay"},{"word":"mā","meaning":"not"},{"word":"vyathiṣhṭhāḥ","meaning":"be disturbed"},{"word":"yudhyasva","meaning":"fight"},{"word":"jetā asi","meaning":"you shall be victorious"},{"word":"raṇe","meaning":"in battle"},{"word":"sapatnān","meaning":"enemies"}]'::jsonb, 'droṇam—Dronacharya; cha—and; bhīṣhmam—Bheeshma; cha—and; jayadratham—Jayadratha; cha—and; karṇam—Karn; tathā—also; anyān—others; api—also; yodha-vīrān—brave warriors; mayā—by me; hatān—already killed; tvam—you; jahi—slay; mā—not; vyathiṣhṭhāḥ—be disturbed; yudhyasva—fight; jetā asi—you shall be victorious; raṇe—in battle; sapatnān—enemies'),
('c17ed87f-a313-5e74-a6c9-4c3cd47c17a2'::uuid, 11, 35, 449, 449, 'सञ्जय उवाच

एतच्छ्रुत्वा वचनं केशवस्य

कृताञ्जलिर्वेपमानः किरीटी।

नमस्कृत्वा भूय एवाह कृष्णं

सगद्गदं भीतभीतः प्रणम्य।।11.35।।', 'sañjaya uvācha
etach chhrutvā vachanaṁ keśhavasya
kṛitāñjalir vepamānaḥ kirīṭī
namaskṛitvā bhūya evāha kṛiṣhṇaṁ
sa-gadgadaṁ bhīta-bhītaḥ praṇamya', '[{"word":"sañjayaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Sanjay said"},{"word":"etat","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"śhrutvā","meaning":"hearing"},{"word":"vachanam","meaning":"words"},{"word":"keśhavasya","meaning":"of Shree Krishna"},{"word":"kṛita","meaning":"añjaliḥ—with joined palms"},{"word":"vepamānaḥ","meaning":"trembling"},{"word":"kirītī","meaning":"the crowned one, Arjun"},{"word":"namaskṛitvā","meaning":"with palms joined"},{"word":"bhūyaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"āha","meaning":"spoke"},{"word":"kṛiṣhṇam","meaning":"to Shree Krishna"},{"word":"sa","meaning":"gadgadam—in a faltering voice"},{"word":"bhīta","meaning":"bhītaḥ—overwhelmed with fear"},{"word":"praṇamya","meaning":"bowed down"}]'::jsonb, 'sañjayaḥ uvācha—Sanjay said; etat—thus; śhrutvā—hearing; vachanam—words; keśhavasya—of Shree Krishna; kṛita-añjaliḥ—with joined palms; vepamānaḥ—trembling; kirītī—the crowned one, Arjun; namaskṛitvā—with palms joined; bhūyaḥ—again; eva—indeed; āha—spoke; kṛiṣhṇam—to Shree Krishna; sa-gadgadam—in a faltering voice; bhīta-bhītaḥ—overwhelmed with fear; praṇamya—bowed down'),
('9fbce802-01b7-5c77-8058-daa347063130'::uuid, 11, 36, 450, 450, 'अर्जुन उवाच

स्थाने हृषीकेश तव प्रकीर्त्या

जगत् प्रहृष्यत्यनुरज्यते च।

रक्षांसि भीतानि दिशो द्रवन्ति

सर्वे नमस्यन्ति च सिद्धसङ्घाः।।11.36।।', 'arjuna uvācha
sthāne hṛiṣhīkeśha tava prakīrtyā
jagat prahṛiṣhyaty anurajyate cha
rakṣhānsi bhītāni diśho dravanti
sarve namasyanti cha siddha-saṅghāḥ', '[{"word":"arjunaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Arjun said"},{"word":"sthāne","meaning":"it is but apt"},{"word":"hṛiṣhīka","meaning":"īśha—Shree Krishna, the master of the senses"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"your"},{"word":"prakīrtyā","meaning":"in praise"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"the universe"},{"word":"prahṛiṣhyati","meaning":"rejoices"},{"word":"anurajyate","meaning":"be enamored"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"rakṣhānsi","meaning":"the demons"},{"word":"bhītāni","meaning":"fearfully"},{"word":"diśhaḥ","meaning":"in all directions"},{"word":"dravanti","meaning":"flee"},{"word":"sarve","meaning":"all"},{"word":"namasyanti","meaning":"bow down"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"siddha","meaning":"saṅghāḥ—hosts of perfected saints"}]'::jsonb, 'arjunaḥ uvācha—Arjun said; sthāne—it is but apt; hṛiṣhīka-īśha—Shree Krishna, the master of the senses; tava—your; prakīrtyā—in praise; jagat—the universe; prahṛiṣhyati—rejoices; anurajyate—be enamored; cha—and; rakṣhānsi—the demons; bhītāni—fearfully; diśhaḥ—in all directions; dravanti—flee; sarve—all; namasyanti—bow down; cha—and; siddha-saṅghāḥ—hosts of perfected saints'),
('36fb947c-3533-5367-82f2-df0bc24358c1'::uuid, 11, 37, 451, 451, 'कस्माच्च ते न नमेरन्महात्मन्

गरीयसे ब्रह्मणोऽप्यादिकर्त्रे।

अनन्त देवेश जगन्निवास

त्वमक्षरं सदसत्तत्परं यत्।।11.37।।', 'kasmāch cha te na nameran mahātman
garīyase brahmaṇo ’py ādi-kartre
ananta deveśha jagan-nivāsa
tvam akṣharaṁ sad-asat tat paraṁ yat', '[{"word":"kasmāt","meaning":"why"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"te","meaning":"you"},{"word":"na nameran","meaning":"should they not bow down"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"ātman—The Great one"},{"word":"garīyase","meaning":"who are greater"},{"word":"brahmaṇaḥ","meaning":"than Brahma"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"ādi","meaning":"kartre—to the original creator"},{"word":"ananta","meaning":"The limitless One"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"īśha—Lord of the devatās"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"nivāsa—Refuge of the universe"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"akṣharam","meaning":"the imperishable"},{"word":"sat","meaning":"asat—manifest and non-manifest"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"param","meaning":"beyond"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"}]'::jsonb, 'kasmāt—why; cha—and; te—you; na nameran—should they not bow down; mahā-ātman—The Great one; garīyase—who are greater; brahmaṇaḥ—than Brahma; api—even; ādi-kartre—to the original creator; ananta—The limitless One; deva-īśha—Lord of the devatās; jagat-nivāsa—Refuge of the universe; tvam—you; akṣharam—the imperishable; sat-asat—manifest and non-manifest; tat—that; param—beyond; yat—which'),
('3c57efa3-e4b2-5a85-a51c-fab9ebaa3a16'::uuid, 11, 38, 452, 452, 'त्वमादिदेवः पुरुषः पुराण

स्त्वमस्य विश्वस्य परं निधानम्।

वेत्तासि वेद्यं च परं च धाम

त्वया ततं विश्वमनन्तरूप।।11.38।।', 'tvam ādi-devaḥ puruṣhaḥ purāṇas
tvam asya viśhvasya paraṁ nidhānam
vettāsi vedyaṁ cha paraṁ cha dhāma
tvayā tataṁ viśhvam ananta-rūpa', '[{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"ādi","meaning":"devaḥ—the original Divine God"},{"word":"puruṣhaḥ","meaning":"personality"},{"word":"purāṇaḥ","meaning":"primeval"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"asya","meaning":"of (this)"},{"word":"viśhwasya","meaning":"universe"},{"word":"param","meaning":"Supreme"},{"word":"nidhānam","meaning":"resting place"},{"word":"vettā","meaning":"the knower"},{"word":"asi","meaning":"you are"},{"word":"vedyam","meaning":"the object of knowledge"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"param","meaning":"Supreme"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"dhāma","meaning":"Abode"},{"word":"tvayā","meaning":"by you"},{"word":"tatam","meaning":"pervaded"},{"word":"viśhwam","meaning":"the universe"},{"word":"ananta","meaning":"rūpa—posessor of infinite forms"}]'::jsonb, 'tvam—you; ādi-devaḥ—the original Divine God; puruṣhaḥ—personality; purāṇaḥ—primeval; tvam—you; asya—of (this); viśhwasya—universe; param—Supreme; nidhānam—resting place; vettā—the knower; asi—you are; vedyam—the object of knowledge; cha—and; param—Supreme; cha—and; dhāma—Abode; tvayā—by you; tatam—pervaded; viśhwam—the universe; ananta-rūpa—posessor of infinite forms'),
('72ece883-3e44-5692-95b5-c801e9590684'::uuid, 11, 39, 453, 453, 'वायुर्यमोऽग्निर्वरुणः शशाङ्कः

प्रजापतिस्त्वं प्रपितामहश्च।

नमो नमस्तेऽस्तु सहस्रकृत्वः

पुनश्च भूयोऽपि नमो नमस्ते।।11.39।।', 'vāyur yamo ’gnir varuṇaḥ śhaśhāṅkaḥ
prajāpatis tvaṁ prapitāmahaśh cha
namo namas te ’stu sahasra-kṛitvaḥ
punaśh cha bhūyo ’pi namo namas te', '[{"word":"vāyuḥ","meaning":"the god of wind"},{"word":"yamaḥ","meaning":"the god of death"},{"word":"agniḥ","meaning":"the god of fire"},{"word":"varuṇaḥ","meaning":"the god of water"},{"word":"śhaśha","meaning":"aṅkaḥ—the moon-God"},{"word":"prajāpatiḥ","meaning":"Brahma"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"prapitāmahaḥ","meaning":"the great-grandfather"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"namaḥ","meaning":"my salutations"},{"word":"namaḥ","meaning":"my salutations"},{"word":"te","meaning":"unto you"},{"word":"astu","meaning":"let there be"},{"word":"sahasra","meaning":"kṛitvaḥ—a thousand times"},{"word":"punaḥ cha","meaning":"and again"},{"word":"bhūyaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"namaḥ","meaning":"(offering) my salutations"},{"word":"namaḥ te","meaning":"offering my salutations unto you"}]'::jsonb, 'vāyuḥ—the god of wind; yamaḥ—the god of death; agniḥ—the god of fire; varuṇaḥ—the god of water; śhaśha-aṅkaḥ—the moon-God; prajāpatiḥ—Brahma; tvam—you; prapitāmahaḥ—the great-grandfather; cha—and; namaḥ—my salutations; namaḥ—my salutations; te—unto you; astu—let there be; sahasra-kṛitvaḥ—a thousand times; punaḥ cha—and again; bhūyaḥ—again; api—also; namaḥ—(offering) my salutations; namaḥ te—offering my salutations unto you'),
('5183d7fc-6a36-584c-840f-dec8ab821965'::uuid, 11, 40, 454, 454, 'नमः पुरस्तादथ पृष्ठतस्ते

नमोऽस्तु ते सर्वत एव सर्व।

अनन्तवीर्यामितविक्रमस्त्वं

सर्वं समाप्नोषि ततोऽसि सर्वः।।11.40।।', 'namaḥ purastād atha pṛiṣhṭhatas te
namo ’stu te sarvata eva sarva
ananta-vīryāmita-vikramas tvaṁ
sarvaṁ samāpnoṣhi tato ’si sarvaḥ', '[{"word":"namaḥ","meaning":"offering salutations"},{"word":"purastāt","meaning":"from the front"},{"word":"atha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"pṛiṣhṭhataḥ","meaning":"the rear"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"namaḥ astu","meaning":"I offer my salutations"},{"word":"te","meaning":"to you"},{"word":"sarvataḥ","meaning":"from all sides"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"all"},{"word":"ananta","meaning":"vīrya—infinite power"},{"word":"amita","meaning":"vikramaḥ—infinite valor and might"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"sarvam","meaning":"everything"},{"word":"samāpnoṣhi","meaning":"pervade"},{"word":"tataḥ","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"asi","meaning":"(you) are"},{"word":"sarvaḥ","meaning":"everything"}]'::jsonb, 'namaḥ—offering salutations; purastāt—from the front; atha—and; pṛiṣhṭhataḥ—the rear; te—to you; namaḥ astu—I offer my salutations; te—to you; sarvataḥ—from all sides; eva—indeed; sarva—all; ananta-vīrya—infinite power; amita-vikramaḥ—infinite valor and might; tvam—you; sarvam—everything; samāpnoṣhi—pervade; tataḥ—thus; asi—(you) are; sarvaḥ—everything'),
('507b156b-d4b6-5d84-9ab9-7b50ae3bbdbf'::uuid, 11, 41, 455, 455, 'सखेति मत्वा प्रसभं यदुक्तं

हे कृष्ण हे यादव हे सखेति।

अजानता महिमानं तवेदं

मया प्रमादात्प्रणयेन वापि।।11.41।।', 'sakheti matvā prasabhaṁ yad uktaṁ
he kṛiṣhṇa he yādava he sakheti
ajānatā mahimānaṁ tavedaṁ
mayā pramādāt praṇayena vāpi', '[{"word":"sakhā","meaning":"friend"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"as"},{"word":"matvā","meaning":"thinking"},{"word":"prasabham","meaning":"presumptuously"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"whatever"},{"word":"uktam","meaning":"addressed"},{"word":"he kṛiṣhṇa","meaning":"O Shree Krishna"},{"word":"he yādava","meaning":"O Shree Krishna, who was born in the Yadu clan"},{"word":"he sakhe","meaning":"O my dear mate"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"ajānatā","meaning":"in ignorance"},{"word":"mahimānam","meaning":"majesty"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"your"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"pramādāt","meaning":"out of negligence"},{"word":"praṇayena","meaning":"out of affection"},{"word":"vā api","meaning":"or else"}]'::jsonb, 'sakhā—friend; iti—as; matvā—thinking; prasabham—presumptuously; yat—whatever; uktam—addressed; he kṛiṣhṇa—O Shree Krishna; he yādava—O Shree Krishna, who was born in the Yadu clan; he sakhe—O my dear mate; iti—thus; ajānatā—in ignorance; mahimānam—majesty; tava—your; idam—this; mayā—by me; pramādāt—out of negligence; praṇayena—out of affection; vā api—or else;'),
('a9beb7a3-faee-52fd-b68c-f425a866141a'::uuid, 11, 42, 456, 456, 'यच्चावहासार्थमसत्कृतोऽसि

विहारशय्यासनभोजनेषु।

एकोऽथवाप्यच्युत तत्समक्षं

तत्क्षामये त्वामहमप्रमेयम्।।11.42।।', 'yach chāvahāsārtham asat-kṛito ’si
