prasīda deveśha jagan-nivāsa', '[{"word":"adṛiṣhṭa","meaning":"pūrvam—that which has not been seen before"},{"word":"hṛiṣhitaḥ","meaning":"great joy"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"having seen"},{"word":"bhayena","meaning":"with fear"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"yet"},{"word":"pravyathitam","meaning":"trembles"},{"word":"manaḥ","meaning":"mind"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"tat","meaning":"that"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"certainly"},{"word":"me","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"darśhaya","meaning":"show"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"Lord"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"prasīda","meaning":"please have mercy"},{"word":"deva","meaning":"īśha—God of gods"},{"word":"jagat","meaning":"nivāsa—abode of the universe"}]'::jsonb, 'adṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam—that which has not been seen before; hṛiṣhitaḥ—great joy; asmi—I am; dṛiṣhṭvā—having seen; bhayena—with fear; cha—yet; pravyathitam—trembles; manaḥ—mind; me—my; tat—that; eva—certainly; me—to me; darśhaya—show; deva—Lord; rūpam—form; prasīda—please have mercy; deva-īśha—God of gods; jagat-nivāsa—abode of the universe'),
('b9169044-c90a-53d0-ad81-c69e3826f833'::uuid, 11, 46, 460, 460, 'किरीटिनं गदिनं चक्रहस्त

मिच्छामि त्वां द्रष्टुमहं तथैव।

तेनैव रूपेण चतुर्भुजेन

सहस्रबाहो भव विश्वमूर्ते।।11.46।।', 'kirīṭinaṁ gadinaṁ chakra-hastam
ichchhāmi tvāṁ draṣhṭum ahaṁ tathaiva
