('6ed28195-eb9d-5603-a951-8dfb26a5614d'::uuid, 11, 47, 461, 461, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

मया प्रसन्नेन तवार्जुनेदं

रूपं परं दर्शितमात्मयोगात्।

तेजोमयं विश्वमनन्तमाद्यं

यन्मे त्वदन्येन न दृष्टपूर्वम्।।11.47।।', 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha
mayā prasannena tavārjunedaṁ
rūpaṁ paraṁ darśhitam ātma-yogāt
tejo-mayaṁ viśhvam anantam ādyaṁ
yan me tvad anyena na dṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said"},{"word":"mayā","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"prasannena","meaning":"being pleased"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"with you"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"param","meaning":"divine"},{"word":"darśhitam","meaning":"shown"},{"word":"ātma","meaning":"yogāt—by my Yogmaya power"},{"word":"tejaḥ","meaning":"mayam—resplendent"},{"word":"viśhwam","meaning":"cosmic"},{"word":"anantam","meaning":"unlimited"},{"word":"ādyam","meaning":"primeval"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"tvat anyena","meaning":"other than you"},{"word":"na dṛiṣhṭa","meaning":"pūrvam—no one has ever seen"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said; mayā—by me; prasannena—being pleased; tava—with you; arjuna—Arjun; idam—this; rūpam—form; param—divine; darśhitam—shown; ātma-yogāt—by my Yogmaya power; tejaḥ-mayam—resplendent; viśhwam—cosmic; anantam—unlimited; ādyam—primeval; yat—which; me—my; tvat anyena—other than you; na dṛiṣhṭa-pūrvam—no one has ever seen'),
('f7f2490b-e367-5eb8-8ca1-9cc7433265a5'::uuid, 11, 48, 462, 462, 'न वेदयज्ञाध्ययनैर्न दानै

र्न च क्रियाभिर्न तपोभिरुग्रैः।

एवंरूपः शक्य अहं नृलोके

द्रष्टुं त्वदन्येन कुरुप्रवीर।।11.48।।', 'na veda-yajñādhyayanair na dānair
na cha kriyābhir na tapobhir ugraiḥ
evaṁ-rūpaḥ śhakya ahaṁ nṛi-loke
draṣhṭuṁ tvad anyena kuru-pravīra', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"veda","meaning":"yajña—by performance of sacrifice"},{"word":"adhyayanaiḥ","meaning":"by study of the Vedas"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"dānaiḥ","meaning":"by charity"},{"word":"na","meaning":"nor"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"kriyābhiḥ","meaning":"by rituals"},{"word":"na","meaning":"not"},{"word":"tapobhiḥ","meaning":"by austerities"},{"word":"ugraiḥ","meaning":"severe"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"rūpaḥ—in this form"},{"word":"śhakyaḥ","meaning":"possible"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"nṛi","meaning":"loke—in the world of the mortals"},{"word":"draṣhṭum","meaning":"to be seen"},{"word":"tvat","meaning":"than you"},{"word":"anyena","meaning":"by another"},{"word":"kuru","meaning":"pravīra—the best of the Kuru warriors"}]'::jsonb, 'na—not; veda-yajña—by performance of sacrifice; adhyayanaiḥ—by study of the Vedas; na—nor; dānaiḥ—by charity; na—nor; cha—and; kriyābhiḥ—by rituals; na—not; tapobhiḥ—by austerities; ugraiḥ—severe; evam-rūpaḥ—in this form; śhakyaḥ—possible; aham—I; nṛi-loke—in the world of the mortals; draṣhṭum—to be seen; tvat—than you; anyena—by another; kuru-pravīra—the best of the Kuru warriors'),
('b4c8a0ce-7c71-5d0b-a6dd-75af2230647b'::uuid, 11, 49, 463, 463, 'मा ते व्यथा मा च विमूढभावो

दृष्ट्वा रूपं घोरमीदृङ्ममेदम्।

व्यपेतभीः प्रीतमनाः पुनस्त्वं

तदेव मे रूपमिदं प्रपश्य।।11.49।।', 'mā te vyathā mā cha vimūḍha-bhāvo
dṛiṣhṭvā rūpaṁ ghoram īdṛiṅ mamedam
vyapeta-bhīḥ prīta-manāḥ punas tvaṁ
tad eva me rūpam idaṁ prapaśhya', '[{"word":"mā te","meaning":"you shout not be"},{"word":"vyathā","meaning":"afraid"},{"word":"mā","meaning":"not"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"vimūḍha","meaning":"bhāvaḥ—bewildered state"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"on seeing"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"ghoram","meaning":"terrible"},{"word":"īdṛik","meaning":"such"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"of mine"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"vyapeta","meaning":"bhīḥ—free from fear"},{"word":"prīta","meaning":"manāḥ—cheerful mind"},{"word":"punaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"tvam","meaning":"you"},{"word":"tat eva","meaning":"that very"},{"word":"me","meaning":"my"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"prapaśhya","meaning":"behold"}]'::jsonb, 'mā te—you shout not be; vyathā—afraid; mā—not; cha—and; vimūḍha-bhāvaḥ—bewildered state; dṛiṣhṭvā—on seeing; rūpam—form; ghoram—terrible; īdṛik—such; mama—of mine; idam—this; vyapeta-bhīḥ—free from fear; prīta-manāḥ—cheerful mind; punaḥ—again; tvam—you; tat eva—that very; me—my; rūpam—form; idam—this; prapaśhya—behold'),
('95c8c7b8-4512-54b0-9268-961973d087b0'::uuid, 11, 50, 464, 464, 'सञ्जय उवाच

इत्यर्जुनं वासुदेवस्तथोक्त्वा

स्वकं रूपं दर्शयामास भूयः।

आश्वासयामास च भीतमेनं

भूत्वा पुनः सौम्यवपुर्महात्मा।।11.50।।', 'sañjaya uvācha
ity arjunaṁ vāsudevas tathoktvā
svakaṁ rūpaṁ darśhayām āsa bhūyaḥ
āśhvāsayām āsa cha bhītam enaṁ
bhūtvā punaḥ saumya-vapur mahātmā', '[{"word":"sañjayaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Sanjay said"},{"word":"iti","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"arjunam","meaning":"to Arjun"},{"word":"vāsudevaḥ","meaning":"Krishna, the son of Vasudev"},{"word":"tathā","meaning":"in that way"},{"word":"uktvā","meaning":"having spoken"},{"word":"svakam","meaning":"his personal"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"darśhayām āsa","meaning":"displayed"},{"word":"bhūyaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"āśhvāsayām āsa","meaning":"consoled"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"bhītam","meaning":"frightened"},{"word":"enam","meaning":"him"},{"word":"bhūtvā","meaning":"becoming"},{"word":"punaḥ","meaning":"again"},{"word":"saumya","meaning":"vapuḥ—the gentle (two-armed) form"},{"word":"mahā","meaning":"ātmā—the compassionate"}]'::jsonb, 'sañjayaḥ uvācha—Sanjay said; iti—thus; arjunam—to Arjun; vāsudevaḥ—Krishna, the son of Vasudev; tathā—in that way; uktvā—having spoken; svakam—his personal; rūpam—form; darśhayām āsa—displayed; bhūyaḥ—again; āśhvāsayām āsa—consoled; cha—and; bhītam—frightened; enam—him; bhūtvā—becoming; punaḥ—again; saumya-vapuḥ—the gentle (two-armed) form; mahā-ātmā—the compassionate'),
('d14e4c70-7b12-54d7-a3e4-727e0ef42eb0'::uuid, 11, 51, 465, 465, 'अर्जुन उवाच

दृष्ट्वेदं मानुषं रूपं तवसौम्यं जनार्दन।

इदानीमस्मि संवृत्तः सचेताः प्रकृतिं गतः।।11.51।।', 'arjuna uvācha
dṛiṣhṭvedaṁ mānuṣhaṁ rūpaṁ tava saumyaṁ janārdana
idānīm asmi saṁvṛittaḥ sa-chetāḥ prakṛitiṁ gataḥ', '[{"word":"arjunaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Arjun said"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭvā","meaning":"seeing"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"mānuṣham","meaning":"human"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"tava","meaning":"your"},{"word":"saumyam","meaning":"gentle"},{"word":"janārdana","meaning":"he who looks after the public, Krishna"},{"word":"idānīm","meaning":"now"},{"word":"asmi","meaning":"I am"},{"word":"saṁvṛittaḥ","meaning":"composed"},{"word":"sa","meaning":"chetāḥ—in my mind"},{"word":"prakṛitim","meaning":"to normality"},{"word":"gataḥ","meaning":"have become"}]'::jsonb, 'arjunaḥ uvācha—Arjun said; dṛiṣhṭvā—seeing; idam—this; mānuṣham—human; rūpam—form; tava—your; saumyam—gentle; janārdana—he who looks after the public, Krishna; idānīm—now; asmi—I am; saṁvṛittaḥ—composed; sa-chetāḥ—in my mind; prakṛitim—to normality; gataḥ—have become'),
('99d77227-ae68-5f59-87c1-7ef93bf4248f'::uuid, 11, 52, 466, 466, 'श्री भगवानुवाच

सुदुर्दर्शमिदं रूपं दृष्टवानसि यन्मम।

देवा अप्यस्य रूपस्य नित्यं दर्शनकाङ्क्षिणः।।11.52।।', 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha
su-durdarśham idaṁ rūpaṁ dṛiṣhṭavān asi yan mama
devā apy asya rūpasya nityaṁ darśhana-kāṅkṣhiṇaḥ', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said"},{"word":"su","meaning":"durdarśham—exceedingly difficult to behold"},{"word":"idam","meaning":"this"},{"word":"rūpam","meaning":"form"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭavān asi","meaning":"that you are seeing"},{"word":"yat","meaning":"which"},{"word":"mama","meaning":"of mine"},{"word":"devāḥ","meaning":"the celestial gods"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even"},{"word":"asya","meaning":"this"},{"word":"rūpasya","meaning":"form"},{"word":"nityam","meaning":"eternally"},{"word":"darśhana","meaning":"kāṅkṣhiṇaḥ—aspiring to see"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Supreme Lord said; su-durdarśham—exceedingly difficult to behold; idam—this; rūpam—form; dṛiṣhṭavān asi—that you are seeing; yat—which; mama—of mine; devāḥ—the celestial gods; api—even; asya—this; rūpasya—form; nityam—eternally; darśhana-kāṅkṣhiṇaḥ—aspiring to see;'),
('0ead38a2-056d-5f6c-b74a-f868d9da38b2'::uuid, 11, 53, 467, 467, 'नाहं वेदैर्न तपसा न दानेन न चेज्यया।

शक्य एवंविधो द्रष्टुं दृष्टवानसि मां यथा।।11.53।।', 'nāhaṁ vedair na tapasā na dānena na chejyayā
śhakya evaṁ-vidho draṣhṭuṁ dṛiṣhṭavān asi māṁ yathā', '[{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"vedaiḥ","meaning":"by study of the Vedas"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"tapasā","meaning":"by serious penances"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"dānena","meaning":"by charity"},{"word":"na","meaning":"never"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"also"},{"word":"ijyayā","meaning":"by worship"},{"word":"śhakyaḥ","meaning":"it is possible"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"vidhaḥ—like this"},{"word":"draṣhṭum","meaning":"to see"},{"word":"dṛiṣhṭavān","meaning":"seeing"},{"word":"asi","meaning":"you are"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"yathā","meaning":"as"}]'::jsonb, 'na—never; aham—I; vedaiḥ—by study of the Vedas; na—never; tapasā—by serious penances; na—never; dānena—by charity; na—never; cha—also; ijyayā—by worship; śhakyaḥ—it is possible; evam-vidhaḥ—like this; draṣhṭum—to see; dṛiṣhṭavān—seeing; asi—you are; mām—me; yathā—as'),
('50560950-f300-5572-8bee-8f9b55023a5b'::uuid, 11, 54, 468, 468, 'भक्त्या त्वनन्यया शक्यमहमेवंविधोऽर्जुन।

ज्ञातुं दृष्टुं च तत्त्वेन प्रवेष्टुं च परंतप।।11.54।।', 'bhaktyā tv ananyayā śhakya aham evaṁ-vidho ’rjuna
jñātuṁ draṣhṭuṁ cha tattvena praveṣhṭuṁ cha parantapa', '[{"word":"bhaktyā","meaning":"by devotion"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"alone"},{"word":"ananyayā","meaning":"unalloyed"},{"word":"śhakyaḥ","meaning":"possible"},{"word":"aham","meaning":"I"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"vidhaḥ—like this"},{"word":"arjuna","meaning":"Arjun"},{"word":"jñātum","meaning":"to be known"},{"word":"draṣhṭum","meaning":"to be seen"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"tattvena","meaning":"truly"},{"word":"praveṣhṭum","meaning":"to enter into (union with me)"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"parantapa","meaning":"scorcher of foes"}]'::jsonb, 'bhaktyā—by devotion; tu—alone; ananyayā—unalloyed; śhakyaḥ—possible; aham—I; evam-vidhaḥ—like this; arjuna—Arjun; jñātum—to be known; draṣhṭum—to be seen; cha—and; tattvena—truly; praveṣhṭum—to enter into (union with me); cha—and; parantapa—scorcher of foes'),
('1a17483b-4df1-5687-9a7b-f16b81db02d6'::uuid, 11, 55, 469, 469, 'मत्कर्मकृन्मत्परमो मद्भक्तः सङ्गवर्जितः।

निर्वैरः सर्वभूतेषु यः स मामेति पाण्डव।।11.55।।', 'mat-karma-kṛin mat-paramo mad-bhaktaḥ saṅga-varjitaḥ
nirvairaḥ sarva-bhūteṣhu yaḥ sa mām eti pāṇḍava', '[{"word":"mat","meaning":"karma-kṛit—perform duties for my sake"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"paramaḥ—considering me the Supreme"},{"word":"mat","meaning":"bhaktaḥ—devoted to me"},{"word":"saṅga","meaning":"varjitaḥ—free from attachment"},{"word":"nirvairaḥ","meaning":"without malice"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūteṣhu—toward all entities"},{"word":"yaḥ","meaning":"who"},{"word":"saḥ","meaning":"he"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"to me"},{"word":"eti","meaning":"comes"},{"word":"pāṇḍava","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Pandu"}]'::jsonb, 'mat-karma-kṛit—perform duties for my sake; mat-paramaḥ—considering me the Supreme; mat-bhaktaḥ—devoted to me; saṅga-varjitaḥ—free from attachment; nirvairaḥ—without malice; sarva-bhūteṣhu—toward all entities; yaḥ—who; saḥ—he; mām—to me; eti—comes; pāṇḍava—Arjun, the son of Pandu'),
('5cb373d4-b326-597d-9896-4f3368ed11bc'::uuid, 12, 1, 470, 470, 'अर्जुन उवाचएवं सततयुक्ता ये भक्तास्त्वां पर्युपासते।येचाप्यक्षरमव्यक्तं तेषां के योगवित्तमाः।।12.1।।', 'arjuna uvācha
evaṁ satata-yuktā ye bhaktās tvāṁ paryupāsate
ye chāpy akṣharam avyaktaṁ teṣhāṁ ke yoga-vittamāḥ', '[{"word":"arjunaḥ uvācha","meaning":"Arjun said"},{"word":"evam","meaning":"thus"},{"word":"satata","meaning":"steadfastly"},{"word":"yuktāḥ","meaning":"devoted"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"those"},{"word":"bhaktāḥ","meaning":"devotees"},{"word":"tvām","meaning":"you"},{"word":"paryupāsate","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"those"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"api","meaning":"also"},{"word":"akṣharam","meaning":"the imperishable"},{"word":"avyaktam","meaning":"the formless Brahman"},{"word":"teṣhām","meaning":"of them"},{"word":"ke","meaning":"who"},{"word":"yoga","meaning":"vit-tamāḥ—more perfect in Yog"}]'::jsonb, 'arjunaḥ uvācha—Arjun said; evam—thus; satata—steadfastly; yuktāḥ—devoted; ye—those; bhaktāḥ—devotees; tvām—you; paryupāsate—worship; ye—those; cha—and; api—also; akṣharam—the imperishable; avyaktam—the formless Brahman; teṣhām—of them; ke—who; yoga-vit-tamāḥ—more perfect in Yog'),
('8209192a-dbcf-591b-b9e0-2877f6c6ed92'::uuid, 12, 2, 471, 471, 'श्री भगवानुवाचमय्यावेश्य मनो ये मां नित्ययुक्ता उपासते।श्रद्धया परयोपेतास्ते मे युक्ततमा मताः।।12.2।।', 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha
mayy āveśhya mano ye māṁ nitya-yuktā upāsate
śhraddhayā parayopetās te me yuktatamā matāḥ', '[{"word":"śhrī","meaning":"bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said"},{"word":"mayi","meaning":"on me"},{"word":"āveśhya","meaning":"fix"},{"word":"manaḥ","meaning":"the mind"},{"word":"ye","meaning":"those"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"nitya yuktāḥ","meaning":"always engaged"},{"word":"upāsate","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"śhraddhayā","meaning":"with faith"},{"word":"parayā","meaning":"best"},{"word":"upetāḥ","meaning":"endowed"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"me","meaning":"by me"},{"word":"yukta","meaning":"tamāḥ—situated highest in Yog"},{"word":"matāḥ","meaning":"I consider"}]'::jsonb, 'śhrī-bhagavān uvācha—the Blessed Lord said; mayi—on me; āveśhya—fix; manaḥ—the mind; ye—those; mām—me; nitya yuktāḥ—always engaged; upāsate—worship; śhraddhayā—with faith; parayā—best; upetāḥ—endowed; te—they; me—by me; yukta-tamāḥ—situated highest in Yog; matāḥ—I consider'),
('686c7422-99fa-5a8c-920d-d775fda753d3'::uuid, 12, 3, 472, 472, 'ये त्वक्षरमनिर्देश्यमव्यक्तं पर्युपासते।सर्वत्रगमचिन्त्यं च कूटस्थमचलं ध्रुवम्।।12.3।।', 'ye tv akṣharam anirdeśhyam avyaktaṁ paryupāsate
sarvatra-gam achintyañcha kūṭa-stham achalandhruvam
 sanniyamyendriya-grāmaṁ sarvatra sama-buddhayaḥ
te prāpnuvanti mām eva sarva-bhūta-hite ratāḥ', '[{"word":"ye","meaning":"who"},{"word":"tu","meaning":"but"},{"word":"akṣharam","meaning":"the imperishable"},{"word":"anirdeśhyam","meaning":"the indefinable"},{"word":"avyaktam","meaning":"the unmanifest"},{"word":"paryupāsate","meaning":"worship"},{"word":"sarvatra","meaning":"gam—the all-pervading"},{"word":"achintyam","meaning":"the unthinkable"},{"word":"cha","meaning":"and"},{"word":"kūṭa","meaning":"stham—the unchanging"},{"word":"achalam","meaning":"the immovable"},{"word":"dhruvam","meaning":"the eternal"},{"word":"sanniyamya","meaning":"restraining"},{"word":"indriya","meaning":"grāmam—the senses"},{"word":"sarvatra","meaning":"everywhere"},{"word":"sama","meaning":"buddhayaḥ—even-minded"},{"word":"te","meaning":"they"},{"word":"prāpnuvanti","meaning":"attain"},{"word":"mām","meaning":"me"},{"word":"eva","meaning":"also"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"bhūta-hite—in the welfare of all beings"},{"word":"ratāḥ","meaning":"engaged"}]'::jsonb, 'ye—who; tu—but; akṣharam—the imperishable; anirdeśhyam—the indefinable; avyaktam—the unmanifest; paryupāsate—worship; sarvatra-gam—the all-pervading; achintyam—the unthinkable; cha—and; kūṭa-stham—the unchanging; achalam—the immovable; dhruvam—the eternal; 
 sanniyamya—restraining; indriya-grāmam—the senses; sarvatra—everywhere; sama-buddhayaḥ—even-minded; te—they; prāpnuvanti—attain; mām—me; eva—also; sarva-bhūta-hite—in the welfare of all beings; ratāḥ—engaged')
