('ad717ff9-d2ea-5c9f-981a-db7901a4eaae'::uuid, 18, 47, 670, 670, 'श्रेयान्स्वधर्मो विगुणः परधर्मात्स्वनुष्ठितात्।स्वभावनियतं कर्म कुर्वन्नाप्नोति किल्बिषम्।।18.47।।', 'śhreyān swa-dharmo viguṇaḥ para-dharmāt sv-anuṣhṭhitāt
svabhāva-niyataṁ karma kurvan nāpnoti kilbiṣham', '[{"word":"śhreyān","meaning":"better"},{"word":"swa","meaning":"dharmaḥ—one’s own prescribed occupational duty"},{"word":"viguṇaḥ","meaning":"imperfectly done"},{"word":"para","meaning":"dharmāt—than another’s dharma"},{"word":"su","meaning":"anuṣhṭhitāt—perfectly done"},{"word":"svabhāva","meaning":"niyatam—according to one’s innate nature"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"kurvan","meaning":"by performing"},{"word":"na āpnoti","meaning":"does not incur"},{"word":"kilbiṣham","meaning":"sin"}]'::jsonb, 'śhreyān—better; swa-dharmaḥ—one’s own prescribed occupational duty; viguṇaḥ—imperfectly done; para-dharmāt—than another’s dharma; su-anuṣhṭhitāt—perfectly done; svabhāva-niyatam—according to one’s innate nature; karma—duty; kurvan—by performing; na āpnoti—does not incur; kilbiṣham—sin'),
('03d1a633-ac3e-5dfd-8b5b-2fc9a2d30c38'::uuid, 18, 48, 671, 671, 'सहजं कर्म कौन्तेय सदोषमपि न त्यजेत्।सर्वारम्भा हि दोषेण धूमेनाग्निरिवावृताः।।18.48।।', 'saha-jaṁ karma kaunteya sa-doṣham api na tyajet
sarvārambhā hi doṣheṇa dhūmenāgnir ivāvṛitāḥ', '[{"word":"saha","meaning":"jam—born of one’s nature"},{"word":"karma","meaning":"duty"},{"word":"kaunteya","meaning":"Arjun, the son of Kunti"},{"word":"sa","meaning":"doṣham—with defects"},{"word":"api","meaning":"even if"},{"word":"na tyajet","meaning":"one should not abandon"},{"word":"sarva","meaning":"ārambhāḥ—all endeavors"},{"word":"hi","meaning":"indeed"},{"word":"doṣheṇa","meaning":"with evil"},{"word":"dhūmena","meaning":"with smoke"},{"word":"agniḥ","meaning":"fire"},{"word":"iva","meaning":"as"},{"word":"āvṛitāḥ","meaning":"veiled"}]'::jsonb, 'saha-jam—born of one’s nature; karma—duty; kaunteya—Arjun, the son of Kunti; sa-doṣham—with defects; api—even if; na tyajet—one should not abandon; sarva-ārambhāḥ—all endeavors; hi—indeed; doṣheṇa—with evil; dhūmena—with smoke; agniḥ—fire; iva—as; āvṛitāḥ—veiled'),
('0b64c096-e168-54ad-b107-571e2fd83aee'::uuid, 18, 49, 672, 672, 'असक्तबुद्धिः सर्वत्र जितात्मा विगतस्पृहः।नैष्कर्म्यसिद्धिं परमां संन्यासेनाधिगच्छति।।18.49।।', 'asakta-buddhiḥ sarvatra jitātmā vigata-spṛihaḥ
